
/* =============================================================================
   LEAVE MANAGEMENT SYSTEM - SCHEMA CREATION SCRIPT
   Target: Microsoft SQL Server 2019 or later
   Keys:   INT IDENTITY

   READ THIS FIRST - three columns were added that are not on your diagram:
     1. LeaveTransaction.LeaveYear   - without it you cannot write the balance query
     2. LeaveRequest.LeaveYear       - so pending hours match the same year
     3. LeaveTransaction.CreatedById / CreatedOn - audit trail for manual adjustments

   Run order matters. Tables are created first without foreign keys, then the
   keys are added at the end. This is because Employee and Department reference
   each other, so neither can be created "second".
   ============================================================================= */


